@startuml BitePlate_Sequence_OrderLifecycle
title BitePlate SRMS — Complete Order Lifecycle (Sequence Diagram)

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2

actor Waiter
participant ":TableService" as TS
participant "Table\n[State Pattern]" as T
participant ":OrderService" as OS
participant "MenuItemFactory\n[Factory Method]" as MF
participant "AllergenFlagDecorator\n[Decorator]" as DEC
participant ":Order\n[Observer Subject]" as O
participant ":KitchenQueue\n[Command Invoker]" as KQ
participant "PrepareOrderCommand\n[Command]" as CMD
participant "Redis List" as R
participant "WaiterNotifier\n[Observer]" as WN
participant "ManagerDashboard\n[Observer]" as MGR
participant ":BillingFacade\n[Facade]" as BF
participant ":PricingStrategy\n[Strategy]" as PS
participant ":TaxCalculator" as TC
participant "OrderHistoryLog\n[Singleton]" as OHL
actor Cashier

== 1. Seat Customer (State Pattern) ==
Waiter -> TS: seatCustomer(tableId=3)
TS -> T: occupy()
T -> T: FreeState.occupy()\nsetStatus(OCCUPIED)\nsetCurrentState(OccupiedState)
TS --> Waiter: Table 3 → OCCUPIED

== 2. Create Order ==
Waiter -> OS: createOrder(tableId=3)
OS -> OS: registerObservers()
OS --> Waiter: Order #42 (PENDING)

== 3. Add Items (Factory + Decorator) ==
Waiter -> OS: addItem(orderId=42, menuItemId=7, qty=2)
OS -> MF: MenuItemFactory.forCategory("MAIN_COURSE")
MF --> OS: MainCourseFactory
OS -> MF: createAndValidate("Ribeye Steak", £28.00)
MF --> OS: new MainCourse
note right: Allergen detected
OS -> DEC: new AllergenFlagDecorator(mainCourse, "gluten")
DEC --> OS: decorated item ⚠️
OS --> Waiter: item added (allergenFlagged=true)

== 4. Submit Order (Command Pattern) ==
Waiter -> OS: submitOrder(orderId=42)
OS -> KQ: execute(new PrepareOrderCommand(order))
KQ -> CMD: execute()
CMD -> O: updateStatus(PREPARING)
O -> WN: onOrderStatusChanged(PREPARING)
O -> MGR: onOrderStatusChanged(PREPARING)
KQ -> R: LPUSH kitchen:queue "PREPARE #42"
KQ --> OS: command queued + executed

== 5. Kitchen Prepares (Command) ==
note over KQ,CMD: Chef views queue, cooks food
KQ -> CMD: execute(ExpediteOrderCommand)
CMD -> O: updateStatus(READY)
O -> WN: onOrderStatusChanged(READY)
WN -> R: PUBLISH notifications:waiter:2\n"ORDER READY: Table 3 #42"
O -> MGR: onOrderStatusChanged(READY)

== 6. Request Bill (State Pattern) ==
Waiter -> TS: requestBill(tableId=3)
TS -> T: awaitBill()
T -> T: OccupiedState.awaitBill()\nsetStatus(AWAITING_BILL)

== 7. Generate Bill (Facade + Strategy) ==
Cashier -> BF: generateBill(order, "STANDARD")
BF -> PS: calculateTotal(order) [StandardPricingStrategy]
PS --> BF: £56.00
BF -> TC: calculateTax(£56.00)
TC --> BF: £11.20 (20% VAT)
BF -> BF: buildLineItems()
BF -> OHL: getInstance().append(OrderRecord)
note right of OHL
  SINGLETON — same instance
  across all subsystems.
  Double-checked locking.
end note
BF --> Cashier: Bill #17 — Total £67.20

== 8. Payment & Clear ==
Cashier -> BF: markPaid(billId=17)
Cashier -> TS: clearTable(tableId=3)
TS -> T: clear()
T -> T: AwaitingBillState.clear()\nsetStatus(CLEARED)\nsetCurrentState(ClearedState)\nclear() → FreeState

@enduml
